{"3233250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "IslaNode Rescue Signal", "steam_appid": 3233250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/68b61ff488cd0463fc254536abcfe7a4.webp?t=1788220878\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IslaNode: Rescue Signal</strong> takes players on a survival adventure like no other, set on a deserted island with nothing but natural resources and your wits. Stranded alone, you’ll need to explore, gather materials, and use a unique node-based crafting system to transform basic elements into survival tools. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/759a13d05418ee81222879f982309024.webp?t=1788220878\" width=600 height=30 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/7a53150c891f4f9ab8381a8ffa3c12bd.poster.avif?t=1788220878\" width=1170 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/7a53150c891f4f9ab8381a8ffa3c12bd.webm?t=1788220878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/7a53150c891f4f9ab8381a8ffa3c12bd.mp4?t=1788220878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building allows you to create more complex shapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/60b37c153ace2361c74ef1cc75c44872.webp?t=1788220878\" width=600 height=30 /></span><